{#
Displays a filters panel, containing 1 or more filters.

Usage:
    ajax:     bool     - whether the filters require a server call to get a new data set, or to filter client-side using JS.
                         For pages where the entire data-set is small and quick to build, it is preferred to send all data
                         to client and have filters applied by JS. For longer requests (eg 'Pending Assessments' on SB Help),
                         the server generates the final HTML each time.
    fillters: Filter[][] - Key value pairs of filter option

#}

<script type="text/javascript" src="/javascript/shared/jquery.filters.js"></script>
<div></div>
